G-Player's game detection (Sources/GPlayerCore/Compat/DetectionRules.swift) includes the file detection rules from
SteamDB's FileDetectionRuleSets (https://github.com/SteamDatabase/FileDetectionRuleSets, commit 243cf741921d2c8fd6b844f83831edf4692cf788), licensed
under the MIT License:
  Copyright (c) 2021 SteamDB
The rules are in Sources/GPlayerCore/Resources/steamdb-rules.ini, unchanged. The second pass that names engines from
